{
  "slug": "comparative-landscape-brief",
  "name": "Comparative Landscape Brief",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Produce a structured briefing document that compares a set of three to eight organizations, products, or initiatives for a third-party audience: investors, board, exec team, M&A committee, partner steering group. Researches each entity, analyzes recent public messaging, runs a third-party verification pass on quantitative claims, and writes a single markdown brief with per-entity sections, cross-cutting observations, and discussion prompts ready for the meeting.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **1 agent**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `comparative-landscape-brief` (Produce a structured comparative briefing document for a third-party audience, across a named set of 3 to 8…), `competitive-brief-generator` (Turn one company name and URL into a three-page competitive intelligence brief rendered as a styled HTML document,…), `pre-call-briefing` (Produce an executive-grade pre-call briefing on a target company for a commercial conversation: prospect discovery, partnership exploration, account…), `signal-watch` (Produce a decision-ready executive briefing on ONE company: what they do, who runs it, what they have been…), `strategic-gtm-intel` (Run a competitive wedge analysis for YOUR company against a named competitor)\n- **Agents** (1): `entity-researcher` (Research and verify one named entity (organization, product, or initiative) for a research brief)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install comparative-landscape-brief@claude-community` from `enalbenerraw/blanewarrene` (`plugins/comparative-landscape-brief`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "agent": 1
  },
